title: 'CIS Amazon Linux 2 Benchmark for Level 2 - Server'

description: |-
    This profile defines a baseline that aligns to the "Level 2 - Server"
    configuration from the Center for Internet Security® Amazon Linux 2
    Benchmark™, v4.0.0, released 2026-03-26.

    This profile includes Center for Internet Security®
    Amazon Linux 2 CIS Benchmarks™ content.

selections:
    - cis_amzn2:all:l2_server
